<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highlands unaware of buyer's identity.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highlands unaware of buyer's identity.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Papua New Guinea gold miner Highlands Gold Ltd said on Wednesday it was unaware of the identity of the buyer of about 18 percent of its capital.</p>
<p>Dealers said earlier that a number of parcels totalling about 113.9 million Highlands shares were bought through broker Macquarie Equities after trading closed at a price of 75 cents.</p>
<p>&quot;We've heard a few rumours about that there may be a bid but it is nothing more than that,&quot; Highlands company secretary Phillip West told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;We certainly haven't seen an approach from anybody.&quot;</p>
</text>
